    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25820" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lāŏcŏon</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Laucŏon</span></b> ),
			ontis, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λαοκόων</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a son of Priam and Hecaba, priest of the Thymbrean
